-moduledoc """
Secret-key message authentication with the default construction,
currently HMAC-SHA-512-256.

`crypto_auth/2` computes a `bytes/0` byte tag for a message under a
`keybytes/0` byte key, and `verify/3` checks one in constant time. The
same key can authenticate many messages; for a streaming interface, use
